  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Wis, +1 Dex\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Perception, Martial Arts\nDark Vision: Even without the power of a fully active Byakugan, you have Darkvision up to 30 feet.\nHyūga Hijutsu: The Hyūga Clan has access to a separate list of jutsu unique to their clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the normal jutsu list(s).\nHijutsu Flexibility: Hyūga Clan Hijutsu can use either Strength or Wisdom as its casting ability score.\nBranch Family: The Hyuga are split between two different branches, the [Main Branch] and the [Side Branch]. The [Main Branch] acts as the nobles of the clan while the [Side Branch], the warriors or guardians. Select which branch your character is a part of. This determines some clan features or which Hijutsu you gain/have access to. This cannot be changed later.",
